    "title": "Kingman to host Coffee with the Mayor and City Manager - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff ,\n1 days ago KINGMAN — The City of Kingman is inviting residents to join Mayor Ken Watkins and City Manager Tim Walsh for the upcoming Coffee with the Mayor and City Manager on Thursday, March 12, from 8:30 a.m. to 10:00 a.m. in the Council Chambers at City Hall, 310 N. Fourth Street. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
